{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "flora_cheat_established",
  "spec": ["flora 5", "flora 5.2", "flora 6.10.4", "flora 4.1"],
  "description": "Derived by hand from flora 5, 5.2, 6.10.4 and 4.1 step 10 (tests 25 and 26 of 16). Cheat 0x230E27AC with data1 = 0x095BDC9C and at least two words: 'Flora off' with 10 flora -> EnableFlora(false): enabled false and every flora of the city (cells listing, null corners) removed; a month then only sets today (the iterator does not move); 'Flora on' -> enabled, nothing restored; 'Flora propogation' -> forced and propagation true; with 'off' both false; 'Flora preserve' -> true, 'preserve off' -> false; word 1 and word 2 are lower-cased; an unknown word does nothing. A bare 'Flora', or another cheat, is handled like ExemplarChanged with data2: the tuning instance 0x1A2FDB6A re-reads the tuning (period 6 -> blocksPerMonth 170); a registered type clears the map (key 0 included) and reloads every type, posting FloraTypesUpdated with the map size 2. 'Flora blast 1 2 10' with the scripted generator: centre (0.5 * 1024, 0.25 * 1024) = (512, 256); seed 1: x = r24(0.1 * 10) + 512 = 513, z = -2 + 256 = 254 -> best type A (0x1000; B is never-auto) -> DropSeed draws u (default 0.5) and plants A (orientation draw); seed 2: x = 1512 >= sizeX -> skipped. The bounds are x < sizeX but z <= sizeZ (quirk): with a clearance radius 0 type, a seed at z = 1024 is planted while one at x = 1024 is skipped without a draw. Test 26: CityEstablished sets propagation := propagationForced (false), CityObliterated := true; Init in an established city gives propagation = forced (false, then true after 'Flora propogation').",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "flora_types", "types": [{"type": "0x1000", "table": 0.6, "clearance": 0}, {"type": "0x2000", "table": 0.6, "never_auto": true}]},
    {"op": "flora_env", "occupants": [
      {"id": 1, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [8, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 2, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [100, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 3, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [200, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 4, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [300, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 5, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [400, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 6, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [500, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 7, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [600, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 8, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [700, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 9, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x2000", "pos": [800, 260, 8]},
      {"id": 10, "type": "flora", "flora_type": "0x2000", "pos": [900, 260, 1000]},
      {"id": 11, "type": "building", "bbox": [[100, 0, 100], [110, 10, 110]]}]},
    {"op": "flora_create"},
    {"op": "flora_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_clear_events"},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora off", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "remove", "occupant": 1}, {"event": "remove", "occupant": 2}, {"event": "remove", "occupant": 3}, {"event": "remove", "occupant": 4},
      {"event": "remove", "occupant": 5}, {"event": "remove", "occupant": 6}, {"event": "remove", "occupant": 7}, {"event": "remove", "occupant": 8},
      {"event": "remove", "occupant": 9}, {"event": "remove", "occupant": 10}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 11, "in_manager": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"enabled": false}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora off", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 40, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"today": 40, "iterator": {"index": 0}}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora on", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"enabled": true}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1, "in_manager": false},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "data1": 70, "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"today": 70, "iterator": {"index": 42}}},

    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora propogation", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"propagation_forced": true, "propagation": true}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora propogation off", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"propagation_forced": false, "propagation": false}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora preserve", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"preserve": true}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora preserve off", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"preserve": false}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "FLORA  PRESERVE", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"preserve": true}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora Preserve OFF", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"preserve": false}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora sideways", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"preserve": false, "enabled": true, "propagation": false, "propagation_forced": false}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": []},

    {"op": "flora_tuning", "shipped": true, "props": {"0x8761ABD0": {"u32": 6}}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "data2": "0x1A2FDB6A", "text": "Flora", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"period": 6, "blocks_per_month": 170}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x12345678", "data2": "0x1000", "text": "Other words here", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "post", "type": "0x87A6277F", "data2": 2}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_registry", "types": ["0x1000", "0x2000"], "keys": ["0x1000", "0x2000"]},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "ExemplarChanged", "data1": 0, "data2": "0x5555", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": []},

    {"op": "flora_set", "state": {"propagation": true}},
    {"op": "flora_rng", "doubles": [0.5, 0.25], "gauss": [0.1, -0.2, 100, 0]},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora blast 1 2 10", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "events": [
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 0.5},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 0.25},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian", "value": 0.1},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian", "value": -0.2},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 0.5},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "range_i32"},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian", "value": 100},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian", "value": 0}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1000, "in_manager": true, "flora_type": "0x1000", "pos": [513, 260, 254]},
    {"op": "flora_rng", "doubles": [1.0, 0.5]},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "blast", "args": [1, 1, 0]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "events": [
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 1.0},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 0.5},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian"},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian"}]},
    {"op": "flora_rng", "doubles": [0.5, 1.0, 0]},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "blast", "args": [1, 1, 0]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "rng"}, "events": [
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 0.5},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 1.0},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian"},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "gaussian"},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "uniform", "value": 0},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "range_i32"}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1001, "in_manager": true, "pos": [512, 260, 1024]},

    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "CityEstablished", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"propagation": false}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "CityObliterated", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"propagation": true}},
    {"op": "flora_env", "established": true},
    {"op": "flora_create"},
    {"op": "flora_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"propagation": false, "propagation_forced": false}},
    {"op": "flora_create"},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "Cheat", "data1": "0x095BDC9C", "text": "Flora propogation", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"propagation": true, "propagation_forced": true}},
    {"op": "flora_message", "type": "CityEstablished", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect", "state": {"propagation": true}}
  ]
}
